    "version":  "1.0.0",
    "description":  "Reproducible SHANGHAI-EVM build of the Hyperlane contracts the FULA Base\u003c-\u003eSKALE bridge deploys (skaled 5.2 lacks Cancun opcodes, so the CLI\u0027s Cancun bytecode cannot run on SKALE).",
